<div style="text-align: center;">
<h4 id="toc0"><span>NOTICE FROM THE FOUNDATION RECORDS AND INFORMATION SECURITY ADMINISTRATION</span></h4>
<p>The following documents have been archived for historical reference. The current documentation for SCP-3987 is located on the fourth tab.</p>
</div>
</div>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: white">__</span></p>
<script type="text/javascript" src="http://d3g0gp89917ko0.cloudfront.net/v--3e3a6f7dbcc9/common--javascript/yahooui/tabview-min.js">
</script>
<div id="wiki-tabview-1d05b03cf1178a86aace6d230e843046" class="yui-navset">
<ul class="yui-nav">
